  <Vertical id="wj1_board">
    <Markdown>
## Your Writer Board

Your turn. This is just an **inventory** of the writing you actually do — it doesn't have to be complete
or tidy, and it isn't asking *why* yet. Just be honest about **what** you write and **how often.**

Your board has **two sides**: the writing you do **for school**, and the writing you do **outside
school.** For each kind of writing, mark whether you do it **Frequently, Sometimes, or Never** — on each
side.

- The same kind of writing can be different on the two sides — that's normal.
- And **count the stuff you don't think counts.** Group chats, captions, lists — Alma almost left those
  off, and they turned out to be most of her board.
    </Markdown>

    <Markdown>### 🏫 Writing I do **FOR SCHOOL**</Markdown>
    <Markdown>*How often do you do each of these **for school**?*</Markdown>
    <TabularMCQ id="wj1_board_school">
cols: Frequently, Sometimes, Never
rows:
  - 💬 Texting and DMs
  - 👥 Group chat messages
  - ✉️ Emails
  - 📝 Class notes
  - 🗂️ Lists, planners, and reminders
  - 📱 Social posts, captions, and comments
  - 📄 Essays, papers, and reports
  - 🎨 Creative writing (stories, poems, song lyrics)
    </TabularMCQ>
    <Markdown>**Anything else you write for school** that isn't a row above? Add it here.</Markdown>
    <TextArea id="wj1_board_school_other" rows="3" placeholder="e.g. lab reports, messages in another language, prompts to AI tools..." />

    <Markdown>### 🌙 Writing I do **OUTSIDE SCHOOL**</Markdown>
    <Markdown>*How often do you do each of these **outside school**?*</Markdown>
    <TabularMCQ id="wj1_board_outside">
cols: Frequently, Sometimes, Never
rows:
  - 💬 Texting and DMs
  - 👥 Group chat messages
  - ✉️ Emails
  - 📝 Notes to myself
  - 🗂️ Lists, planners, and reminders
  - 📱 Social posts, captions, and comments
  - 📄 Longer writing (blogs, fan fiction, reviews)
  - 🎨 Creative writing (stories, poems, song lyrics)
    </TabularMCQ>
    <Markdown>**Anything else you write outside school** that isn't a row above? Add it here.</Markdown>
    <TextArea id="wj1_board_outside_other" rows="3" placeholder="e.g. messages to family, texts in another language, journaling, gaming chat..." />
    <Done id="wj1_board_done" />
  </Vertical>

  <!-- ===================================================================
       CLOSING TASK 1 — THE NOTICING QUESTION
       Optional one-line open response. Ungraded. The student does the
       noticing, so the system does not have to predict anything.
