  <Vertical id="wj1_board_noticing">
    <Markdown>
## One Thing You Noticed

*Alma leans over:* **"Did anything end up on there that you wouldn't have called writing before you sat
down?"**

You don't have to answer — but if something jumped out, name it.
    </Markdown>
    <TextArea id="wj1_board_noticing_text" rows="2" placeholder="The thing I almost didn't count as writing was..." />
  </Vertical>

